{
  "id": "LUK.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luk 19",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu kɛnɛ Dhɛ̈-ki-yäth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu wä kä Jɛ-ri-ko, kä cuɛ rët kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te kuäär thuɔ̱l tho̱lbo̱kä mi cɔal i̱ Dhɛ̈-ki-yäth mi riäŋ riäŋ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ go̱r ɛn ɣöö bɛ Yecu nɛn mi ɛ ram mi te di, kä kui̱ bunä, kɛ ɣöö ɛ wut mi ciɛk ciɛk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cuɛ riŋ nhiam, kä cuɛ wä kɔt wi̱i̱ jiaath, kɛ ɣöö bɛ Yecu nɛn, kɛ ɣöö bɛ rët kɛ jɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Yecu cop ɛn guäth ɛmɔ, cuɛ nhial liɛc kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Dhɛ̈-ki-yäth, bër piny kɛ pɛ̈th, kɛ ɣöö bä dhil wä te cieŋdu ɛn walɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ben piny kɛ pɛ̈th, kä cuɛ jɛ nyuɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy diaal tëë ca jɛ nɛn, ɛ tok kɛ mi kɛ wäkɛ i̱, “Jɛn bɛ wa̱a̱ ja̱l raam mi gua̱n dueeri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Dhɛ̈-ki-yäth cuɔ̱ŋ ɛn wi̱ni, kä cuɛ Kuäär ni Yecu jiök i̱, “Nɛn ɛ, Kuäärä, bä kui̱c kɛl kä nyinkä diaal ka̱m nɛy ti can. Kä mi cä raan mac kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r, bä jɛ cuɔ̱lɛ ni kä ŋuaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ɛ jiök i̱, “Walɛ ci ka̱n teekä ben cieŋ ɛmɛ, kɛ ɣöö jɛn bä ɛ gat A-bɛ-ram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bä Gat Ran kɛ ɣöö bɛ nɛy ti ci bath ben go̱r, kä bɛ kɛ kän.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cäät yio̱o̱ni dääpä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë liŋ naath ŋɔaani ti̱ti̱, cu Yecu ruac cäätdä lat, kɛ ɣöö cɛ thia̱k kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛnɛ ɣöö cukɛ jɛ car bi ciaŋ kuäärä Kuɔth mal ben ni ɛn guäth ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ cuɛ wee i̱, “Ci wut mi luɔ̱thkɛ jiɛɛn, wëë ro̱o̱l mi na̱n, kɛ ɣöö bɛ buɔ̱m kuäärä wä jek kä bɛ luny jɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kuaanykɛ da̱ŋ wäl cɔl, kä cuɛ kɛ ka̱m yio̱w dääpä da̱ŋ wäl. Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, ‘La̱a̱tdɛ yio̱w ti̱ti̱ amäni mi cä luny jɔk.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö cu ji̱ röölɛ jɛ nyir kä cukɛ naath jäkä kɔɔrɛ, wäkɛ i̱, ‘Cakɔ jɛ go̱r ɛn ɣöö bi wut ɛmɔ a kuäära.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ luny jɔk, kä cɛ buɔ̱m kuäärä jek, cuɛ la̱a̱tkɛ tëë cɛ ka̱m yio̱w cɔl, kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ ben ŋa̱c ɛŋu mi ca jek ala rëp kɛ läätni yio̱o̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ram in nhiam ben nhiamdɛ, wëë i̱, ‘Kuäär, yiëëth dääpädu cɛ yio̱w da̱ŋ wäl.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Gɔaaɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Ɛ ji̱n läät mi gɔaa. Kɛ ɣöö ŋa̱a̱thä ji̱ kɛ yuɔ̱p kä min tɔt, bi a kuäär wi̱i̱ni da̱ŋ wäl.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram in rɛwdɛ ben bä, cuɛ wee i̱, ‘Kuäär, yiëëth dääpädu cɛ yio̱w da̱ŋ dhieec kɔ̱kiɛn nööŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Bi ji̱n a rueec wi̱i̱ni da̱ŋ dhieec.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ram in dɔ̱diɛn ben, kä cuɛ wee i̱, ‘Kuäär, yiëëth dääpädu mɛn. Cä jɛ yiɛn kɛ bi̱i̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cä dual kɛ ji̱, kɛ ɣöö ɛ ji̱n ram mi tekɛ ruac mi jiääk. Kä la käni ti /ci tɔ̱ a nyinku, kä la ŋɛɛri ti /keni pith.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Bä ji̱ luk nikɛ ruaacni thuɔkdu pa̱ny lö kuany mi jiääk! Ɛpuc, ci jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän ram mi bɛc ruacdɛ, kä ka̱nä ti /ci tɔ̱ a nyinkä, kä ŋɛ̈ɛ̈rä ti /ka̱n pith? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kuɛ la ŋu /keni yio̱o̱kä la̱th guäth tɔ̱wä yio̱o̱ni mɔ? Kɛ ɣöö mi ca luny jɔk dëë kɛ ka̱n kɛ rëpdiɛn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nɛy ti cuŋ gekädɛ jiök i̱, ‘Ka̱nɛ yiëëth dääpä kä jɛ, kä ka̱mɛ jɛ ram in tekɛ yio̱w da̱ŋ wäl.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, ‘Kuäär, jɛn akɛ yio̱w da̱ŋ wäl!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Kä ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, ram mi tekɛ ti ŋuan ba jɛ ma̱t ti ŋuan. Kä ram mi thil ŋu, a cäŋɛ ni min tekɛ jɛ, ba ka̱n kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kui̱ ji̱ tɛ̈rä ti̱ti̱, tin lökɛ ɣöö bäkɛ ruac, nööŋɛ kɛ wanɛ mɛ, kä na̱kɛ kɛ nhiamdä.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cuɔ̱p Yecu kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Yecu mɛmɛ lar, cuɛ wä nhiam kä kɛ, wëë kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.19.28"
            ]
          }
